<li about=#cite_note-16 id=cite_note-16 data-mw-footnote-number=16><span class=mw-cite-backlink id=mwDOc><a href=#cite_ref-16 rel=mw:referencedBy id=mwDOg aria-label="Jump up" title="Jump up"><span class="mw-linkback-text sf-hidden" id=mwDOk>↑</span></a></span> <span id=mw-reference-text-cite_note-16 class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel=mw-deduplicated-inline-style href=mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106 about=#mwt61 typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id=mwDOo data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Cite news ","href":"./Template:Cite_news"},"params":{"date":{"wt":"9 January 2021"},"title":{"wt":"Wikipedia is 20, and its reputation has never been higher"},"newspaper":{"wt":"The Economist"},"url":{"wt":"https://www.economist.com/international/2021/01/09/wikipedia-is-20-and-its-reputation-has-never-been-higher"},"access-date":{"wt":"29 August 2022"},"issn":{"wt":"0013-0613"},"archive-date":{"wt":"31 December 2022"},"archive-url":{"wt":"https://web.archive.org/web/20221231224550/https://www.economist.com/international/2021/01/09/wikipedia-is-20-and-its-reputation-has-never-been-higher"},"url-status":{"wt":"live"}},"i":0}}]}'><cite class="citation news cs1" about=#mwt61 id=mwDOs><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href=https://www.economist.com/international/2021/01/09/wikipedia-is-20-and-its-reputation-has-never-been-higher class="external text" id=mwDOw>"Wikipedia is 20, and its reputation has never been higher"</a>. <i id=mwDO0>The Economist</i>. January 9, 2021. <a rel=mw:WikiLink href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISSN_(identifier) title="ISSN (identifier)" class=mw-redirect id=mwDO4>ISSN</a><span typeof=mw:Entity id=mwDO8>&nbsp;</span><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href=https://search.worldcat.org/issn/0013-0613 class="external text" id=mwDPA>0013-0613</a>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href=https://web.archive.org/web/20221231224550/https://www.economist.com/international/2021/01/09/wikipedia-is-20-and-its-reputation-has-never-been-higher class="external text" id=mwDPE>Archived</a> from the original on December 31, 2022<span class=reference-accessdate id=mwDPI>. Retrieved <span class=nowrap id=mwDPM>August 29,</span> 2022</span>.</cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=The+Economist&amp;rft.atitle=Wikipedia+is+20%2C+and+its+reputation+has+never+been+higher&amp;rft.date=2021-01-09&amp;rft.issn=0013-0613&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.economist.com%2Finternational%2F2021%2F01%2F09%2Fwikipedia-is-20-and-its-reputation-has-never-been-higher&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AHistory+of+Wikipedia" class=Z3988 about=#mwt61 id=mwDPQ></span></span></li>
<li about=#cite_note-thehive-17 id=cite_note-thehive-17 data-mw-footnote-number=17><span class=mw-cite-backlink id=mwDPU><a href=#cite_ref-thehive_17-0 rel=mw:referencedBy id=mwDPY aria-label="Jump up" title="Jump up"><span class="mw-linkback-text sf-hidden" id=mwDPc>↑</span></a></span> <span id=mw-reference-text-cite_note-thehive-17 class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel=mw-deduplicated-inline-style href=mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106 about=#mwt1034 typeof=mw:Extension/templatestyles id=mwDPg data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""}}'><cite id=CITEREFPoe2006 class="citation news cs1"><a rel=mw:WikiLink href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marshall_Poe title="Marshall Poe" id=mwDPk>Poe, Marshall</a> (September 2006). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href=https://www.theatlantic.com/doc/200609/wikipedia/ class="external text" id=mwDPo>"The Hive"</a>. <i id=mwDPs>The Atlantic Monthly</i>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href=https://web.archive.org/web/20061223004004/http://www.theatlantic.com/doc/200609/wikipedia class="external text" id=mwDPw>Archived</a> from the original on December 23, 2006<span class=reference-accessdate id=mwDP0>. Retrieved <span class=nowrap id=mwDP4>March 25,</span> 2007</span>. <q id=mwDP8>Wales and Sanger created the first Nupedia wiki on 10 January 2001. The initial purpose was to get the public to add entries that would then be "fed into the Nupedia process" of authorization. Most of Nupedia's expert volunteers, however, wanted nothing to do with this, so Sanger decided to launch a separate site called "Wikipedia". Neither Sanger nor Wales looked on Wikipedia as anything more than a lark. This is evident in Sanger's flip announcement of Wikipedia to the Nupedia discussion list. "Humor me", he wrote. "Go there and add a little article. It will take all of five or ten minutes". And, to Sanger's surprise, go they did. Within a few days, Wikipedia outstripped Nupedia in terms of quantity, if not quality, and a small community developed. In late January, Sanger created a Wikipedia discussion list (Wikipedia-L) to facilitate discussion of the project.</q></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=The+Atlantic+Monthly&amp;rft.atitle=The+Hive&amp;rft.date=2006-09&amp;rft.aulast=Poe&amp;rft.aufirst=Marshall&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.theatlantic.com%2Fdoc%2F200609%2Fwikipedia%2F&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AHistory+of+Wikipedia" class=Z3988 id=mwDQA></span></span></li>
