Before that, the first edits that had been known were to <a rel=mw:WikiLink href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:PermanentLink/291430 title=Special:PermanentLink/291430 id=mwDgA>Wikipedia:UuU</a>, <a rel=mw:WikiLink href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:PermanentLink/286342 title=Special:PermanentLink/286342 id=mwDgE>TransporT</a>, and <a rel=mw:WikiLink href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:PermanentLink/11992008 title=Special:PermanentLink/11992008 id=mwDgI>User:ScottMoonen</a> on 16 January 2001.</span></li>
