6071359/https://www.washingtonpost.com/wp-dyn/content/article/2007/09/16/AR2007091601699.html&quot;},&quot;url-status&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;live&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id=CITEREFVargas2007 class="citation news cs1" about=#mwt764>Vargas, Jose Antonio (September 17, 2007). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href=http://www.washingtonpost.com/wp-dyn/content/article/2007/09/16/AR2007091601699.html class="external text" id=mwFbI>"On Wikipedia, Debating 2008 Hopefuls' Every Facet"</a>. <i id=mwFbM><a rel=mw:WikiLink href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Washington_Post title="The Washington Post" id=mwFbQ>The Washington Post</a></i>. <a rel=mw:WikiLink href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISSN_(identifier) title="ISSN (identifier)" class=mw-redirect id=mwFbU>ISSN</a><span typeof=mw:Entity id=mwFbY>&nbsp;</span><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href=https://search.worldcat.org/issn/0190-8286 class="external text" id=mwFbc>0190-8286</a>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href=https://web.archive.org/web/20230116071359/https://www.washingtonpost.com/wp-dyn/content/article/2007/09/16/AR2007091601699.html class="external text" id=mwFbg>Archived</a> from the original on January 16, 2023<span class=reference-accessdate id=mwFbk>. Retrieved <span class=nowrap id=mwFbo>March 16,</span> 2023</span>. <q id=mwFbs>...at the same time, it's hard to find a more up-to-date, detailed, thorough article on <a rel=mw:WikiLink href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Barack_Obama title="Barack Obama" id=mwFbw>Obama</a> than Wikipedia's. As of Friday, Obama's article – more than 22 pages long, with 15 sections covering his personal and professional life – had a reference list of 167 sources.</q></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=The+Washington+Post&amp;rft.atitle=On+Wikipedia%2C+Debating+2008+Hopefuls%27+Every+Facet&amp;rft.date=2007-09-17&amp;rft.issn=0190-8286&amp;rft.aulast=Vargas&amp;rft.aufirst=Jose+Antonio&amp;rft_id=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.washingtonpost.com%2Fwp-dyn%2Fcontent%2Farticle%2F2007%2F09%2F16%2FAR2007091601699.html&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AHistory+of+Wikipedia" class=Z3988 about=#mwt764 id=mwFb0></span></span></li>
